## Configuration Management

### Environment Variables

#### Required Variables
```bash
# Strategy Repository Configuration
export STRATEGIES_REPOSITORY="https://github.com/swift-debugging/strategies.git"
export STRATEGIES_BRANCH="main"

# Authentication (if required)
export STRATEGIES_AUTH_TYPE="token"  # none, token, ssh_key
export STRATEGIES_AUTH_TOKEN="your_github_token"

# Server Configuration
export MCP_SERVER_HOST="localhost"
export MCP_SERVER_PORT="8000"
export MCP_TRANSPORT="stdio"  # stdio, websocket
export MCP_LOG_LEVEL="INFO"   # DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR
```

#### Environment Files
```bash
# .env.development
STRATEGIES_REPOSITORY=https://github.com/swift-debugging/strategies.git
STRATEGIES_BRANCH=develop
STRATEGIES_AUTH_TYPE=token
STRATEGIES_AUTH_TOKEN=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
MCP_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
MCP_TRANSPORT=stdio

# .env.testing
STRATEGIES_REPOSITORY=tests/fixtures/test-strategies
STRATEGIES_BRANCH=main
MCP_LOG_LEVEL=WARNING
MCP_TRANSPORT=stdio

# .env.production
STRATEGIES_REPOSITORY=https://github.com/swift-debugging/strategies.git
STRATEGIES_BRANCH=main
STRATEGIES_AUTH_TYPE=token
STRATEGIES_AUTH_TOKEN=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
MCP_LOG_LEVEL=INFO
MCP_TRANSPORT=websocket
MCP_SERVER_HOST=0.0.0.0
MCP_SERVER_PORT=8000
```

### Configuration Files

#### YAML Configuration
```yaml
# config.yaml
repository:
  url: "https://github.com/swift-debugging/strategies.git"
  branch: "main"
  auth_type: "token"
  auth_token: "${GITHUB_TOKEN}"
  polling_interval: 300
  cache_dir: ".cache/strategies"

server:
  host: "localhost"
  port: 8000
  transport: "stdio"
  log_level: "INFO"
  max_workers: 4

search:
  index_dir: ".cache/search_index"
  max_results: 100
  enable_fuzzy_search: true
  relevance_threshold: 0.1

monitoring:
  enable_metrics: false
  metrics_port: 9090
  enable_tracing: false
```

#### Configuration Loading
```python
# Load configuration from multiple sources
from swift_debugging_mcp_server.config import load_config

# Priority order: CLI args > env vars > config file > defaults
config = load_config(
    config_file="config.yaml",
    env_prefix="MCP_"
)
```

